  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plant fruit trees and raise happy healthy children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project campaign will plant 100 fruit trees in each benefiting rural school in Nigeria to help vulnerable children with improved nutritional benefits and save kids from wildlife attacks and human-induced assaults.  We are using fruit trees as a resource to raise happy, healthy children who lead the future with confidence. The project also helps prevent schoolchildren from missing classes while searching for food to eat in bushes during school hours and develops young climate action leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
